egies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for ENR accounting activities\"},{\"id\":\"pco7\",\"title\":\"PCO7-S\",\"desc\":\"Recommends strategies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for planning, initiating and operationalizing strategies and schemes for financing environmental projects\"},{\"id\":\"pco8\",\"title\":\"PCO8-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for implementing RBME and environmental audit activities for different ENRM sites\"},{\"id\":\"pco9\",\"title\":\"PCO9-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for environmental governance activities\"},{\"id\":\"pco10\",\"title\":\"PCO10-S\",\"desc\":\"Recommends strategies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for applying mitigating measures and adaptive solutions to climate change\"},{\"id\":\"pco11\",\"title\":\"PCO11-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for conducting social marketing and extension support activities to improve ENRM\"},{\"id\":\"pco12\",\"title\":\"PCO12-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, policies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for conducting social negotiation activities\"},{\"id\":\"pco13\",\"title\":\"PCO13-S\",\"desc\":\"Introduces strategies on ENR operation and recommends policies on environmental protection and management (forest protection strategies, denying the source, cutting off routes and denying the market); conducts training of field staff in implementing ENR rules and regulations; collaborates and networks with institutions, law enforcement agencies, NGOs, media and other concerned stakeholders; establishes and maintains linkages; and acts as resource person on ENR laws and rules and regulations\"},{\"id\":\"pco14\",\"title\":\"PCO14-S\",\"desc\":\"Recommends plans, programs and policies on land management activities\"},{\"id\":\"pco15\",\"title\":\"PCO15-S\",\"desc\":\"Recommends plans, strategies, programs and policies on forest, water and wildlife resource utilization and regulation activities\"},{\"id\":\"pco16\",\"title\":\"PCO16-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for evaluating the effectiveness of tenure holders based on organizational, stewardship, protection and management capabilities\"},{\"id\":\"pco17\",\"title\":\"PCO17-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for issuing tenurial instruments and permits for improved resource management\"}]}}}', 19, 19, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-28 02:44:38', '2026-10-28 02:44:38');
