",\"title\":\"PCO15-S\",\"desc\":\"Recommends plans, strategies, programs and policies on forest, water and wildlife resource utilization and regulation activities\"},{\"id\":\"pco16\",\"title\":\"PCO16-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for evaluating the effectiveness of tenure holders based on organizational, stewardship, protection and management capabilities\"},{\"id\":\"pco17\",\"title\":\"PCO17-S\",\"desc\":\"Formulates and recommends strategies, guidelines, procedures and criteria for issuing tenurial instruments and permits for improved resource management\"}]}}}', 18, 18, NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-10-28 02:44:38', '2026-10-28 02:44:38'),
